</td><td>64.9</td><td>59.9</td></tr></tbody></table><p style="margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(180, 83, 9);">* Source-limited: the available waste heat covers only part of the demand above T_sink. The second figure is the full requirement; the rest still has to come from a utility.</p><p style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139);">Click on any column header to sort. Click on any point in the chart to inspect its details and add it to the table.</p></div></div><div class="pa-right-col"><div class="pa-card pa-opt-row" style="gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start;"><div class="pa-opt-filters" style="gap: 1rem; background: rgb(248, 250, 252); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(226, 232, 240);"><div><label style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">MEDIUM SINK</label><select style="padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 23, 42); min-width: 150px; width: 100%;"><option value="All">All</option><option value="Custom">Custom</option><option value="Steam">Steam</option><option value="Water">Water</option><option value="—">—</option></select></div><div><label style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">REFRIGERANT TYPE</label><select style="padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 23, 42); min-width: 150px; width: 100%;"><option value="All">All</option><option value="Custom formula">Custom formula</option><option value="Natural">Natural</option><option value="Synthetic">Synthetic</option><option value="Theoretical">Theoretical</option></select></div><div style="position: relative;"><label style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">REFRIGERANT<