el style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">REFRIGERANT</label><div style="padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 23, 42); min-width: 150px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%;"><span style="overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;">All</span><span style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-left: 8px;">▼</span></div></div><div style="position: relative;"><label style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">NR. COMPRESSORS</label><div style="padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 23, 42); min-width: 150px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%;"><span style="overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;">All</span><span style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-left: 8px;">▼</span></div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;"><button style="padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; background: rgb(37, 99, 235); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: medium; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">Select All</button><button style="padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; background: rgb(220, 38, 38); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: medium; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">Clear Selection</button><p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); text-align: center; font-weight: 500;">Feasible Combinations: 289<br><span style="font-weight: 400;">shown in chart: 259</span></p></div><div class="cf-cop-row"><div><div class="cf-trigger-head"><label style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">COP MODEL</label></div><div class="cf-trigger-row"><button class="cf-trigger" title="The 2-temperature COP model (source out, sink out): the heat pump drawn, values can be tried and the COP is shown">COP model</button></div></div><div class="cf-trigger-block"><div class="cf-trigger-head"><label style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">COP SOURCE</label><div class="chart-help-container inline"><button class="btn btn-sm chart-help-btn  " title="Show explanation"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="cf-trigger-row"><button class="cf-trigger " title="A custom COP formula can be pasted here to run the integration and optimization with a specific heat pump.">ƒ Use my own COP formula</button></div></div></div><details><summary style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer;">More options</summary><div class="pa-opt-toggles" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 0.75rem;"><label style="margin-top: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); cursor: pointer;"><input style="margin-top: 0.15rem;" type="checkbox" checked=""><span>Show theoretical heat pumps (1)<br><span style="font-size: 0.75rem;">Carnot and the best technology archetype, as reference points against the modelled machines.</span></span></label><label style="margin-top: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); cursor: pointer;"><input style="margin-top: 0.15rem;" type="checkbox"><span>Plot source-limited points (7)<br><span style="font-size: 0.75rem;">These cover only part of the demand up to the sink temperature, so they lie off the sink profile.</span></span></label><label style="margin-top: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); cursor: pointer;"><input style="margin-top: 0.15rem;" type="checkbox"><span>Plot demand-limited points (23)<br><span style="font-size: 0.75rem;">These cover the full demand but leave waste heat unused at the source temperature, so they lie off the source profile.</span></span></label></div></details></div><div class="pa-opt-chart" style="display: flex; min-width: 0px; overflow: hidden;"><div data-testid="chart">{"points":"259:e66aa9f0","maxQ":"Test@113","selected":[],"pinch":73,"mode":"net_load"}<button data-testid="chart-pick"></button></div></div></div></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`HPIOptimizationPanel > renders the same for every control > optimization.panel.filters.refrigerant_open 1`] = `"<div class="analysis-panel " style="margin-top: 2rem;"><div class="pa-split-layout"><div class="pa-left-col"><div class="pa-hp-table-wrap" style="max-height: 440px; overflow-y: auto;"><table class="pa-table pa-hp-table"><thead style="position: sticky; top: 0px; z-index: 2;"><tr class="pa-hp-groups"><th colspan="6" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(124,58,237,0.13), rgba(124,58,237,0.13)), var(--surface);">Heat pump</th><th colspan="4" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(143,174,224,0.20), rgba(143,174,224,0.20)), var(--surface); border-left: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--text-main) 40%, transparent);">Sink</th><th colspan="3" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(232,139,139,0.20), rgba(232,139,139,0.20)), var(--surface); border-left: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--text-main) 40%, transparent);">Source</th></tr><tr><th style="cursor: pointer; user-select: none; white-space: nowrap; min-width: 190px; background: linear-gradient(rgba(124,58,237,0.13), rgba(124,58,237,0.13)), var(--surface);"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.25rem;">TYPE<span><div class="chart-help-container inline"><button class="btn btn-sm chart-help-btn  " title="Show explanation"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button></div></span><span style="margin-left: 4px; font-size: 1em; opacity: 1;">↓</span></div></th><th style="cursor: pointer; user-select: none; white-space: nowrap; background: linear-gradient(rgba(124,58,237,0.13), rgba(124,58,237,0.13)), var(--surface);"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.25rem;">REFRIGERANT<span><div class="chart-help-container inline"><button class="btn btn-sm chart-help-btn  " title="Show explanation"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button></div></span></div></th><th style="cursor: pointer; user-select: none; white-space: nowrap; background: linear-gradient(rgba(124,58,237,0.13), rgba(124,58,237,0.13)), var(--surface);"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.25rem;">COMPR.<span><div class="chart-help-container inline"><button class="btn btn-sm chart-help-btn  " title="Show explanation"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button></div></span></div></th><th style="cursor: pointer; user-select: none; white-space: nowrap; width: 1%; background: linear-gradient(rgba(124,58,237,0.13), rgba(124,58,237,0.13)), var(--surface);"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.25rem;">REFRIG. TYPE<span><div class="chart-help-container inline"><button class="btn btn-sm chart-help-btn  " title="Show explanation"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button></div></span></div></th><th style="cursor: pointer; user-select: none; white-space: nowrap; background: linear-gradient(rgba(124,58,237,0.13), rgba(124,58,237,0.13)), var(--surface);"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.25rem;"><span class="notranslate">COP</span><span><div class="chart-help-container inline"><button class="btn btn-sm chart-help-btn  " title="Show explanation"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button></div></span></div></th><th style="cursor: pointer; user-select: none; white-space: nowrap; background: linear-gradient(rgba(124,58,237,0.13), rgba(124,58,237,0.13)), var(--surface);"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.25rem;"><span style="text-transform: none;">P<sub>el</sub> (kW)</span><span><div class="chart-help-container inline"><button class="btn btn-sm chart-help-btn  " title="Show explanation"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button></div></span></div></th><th style="cursor: pointer; user-select: none; white-space: nowrap; background: linear-gradient(rgba(143,174,224,0.20), rgba(143,174,224,0.20)), var(--surface); border-left: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--text-main) 40%, transparent);"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.25rem;">MEDIUM<span><div class="chart-help-container inline"><button class="btn btn-sm chart-help-btn  " title="Show explanation"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" cla