 style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">REFRIGERANT</label><div style="padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 23, 42); min-width: 150px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%;"><span style="overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;">All</span><span style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-left: 8px;">▼</span></div><div style="position: absolute; top: 100%; left: 0px; margin-top: 4px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); border-radius: 4px; z-index: 10; width: 100%; padding: 0.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); max-height: 200px; overflow-y: auto;"><label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.25rem 0px; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(15, 23, 42);"><input type="checkbox">Butane</label><label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.25rem 0px; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(15, 23, 42);"><input type="checkbox">Carnot</label><label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.25rem 0px; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(15, 23, 42);"><input type="checkbox">Isobutane</label><label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.25rem 0px; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(15, 23, 42);"><input type="checkbox">Isopentane</label><label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.25rem 0px; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(15, 23, 42);"><input type="checkbox">R1224yd</label><label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.25rem 0px; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(15, 23, 42);"><input type="checkbox">R1233zd</label><label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.25rem 0px; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(15, 23, 42);"><input type="checkbox">R1234ZEE</label><label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.25rem 0px; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(15, 23, 42);"><input type="checkbox">R1336mzzZ</label><label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.25rem 0px; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(15, 23, 42);"><input type="checkbox">Test</label></div></div><div style="position: relative;"><label style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">NR. COMPRESSORS</label><div style="padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 23, 42); min-width: 150px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%;"><span style="overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;">All</span><span style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-left: 8px;">▼</span></div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;"><button style="padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; background: rgb(37, 99, 235); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: medium; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">Select All</button><button style="padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; background: rgb(220, 38, 38); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: medium; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">Clear Selection</button><p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); text-align: center; font-weight: 500;">Feasible Combinations: 289<br><span style="font-weight: 400;">shown in chart: 259</span></p></div><div class="cf-cop-row"><div><div class="cf-trigger-head"><label style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">COP MODEL</label></div><div class="cf-trigger-row"><button class="cf-trigger" title="The 2-temperature COP model (source out, sink out): the heat pump drawn, values can be tried and the COP is shown">COP model</button></div></div><div class="cf-trigger-block"><div class="cf-trigger-head"><label style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">COP SOURCE</label><div class="chart-help-container inline"><button class="btn btn-sm chart-help-btn  " title="Show explanation"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="cf-trigger-row"><button class="cf-trigger " title="A custom COP formula can be pasted here to run the integration and optimization with a specific heat pump.">ƒ Use my own COP formula</button></div></div></div><details><summary style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer;">More options</summary><div class="pa-opt-toggles" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 0.75rem;"><label style="margin-top: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); cursor: pointer;"><input style="margin-top: 0.15rem;" type="checkbox" checked=""><span>Show theoretical heat pumps (1)<br><span style="font-size: 0.75rem;">Carnot and the best technology archetype, as reference points against the modelled machines.</span></span></label><label style="margin-top: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); cursor: pointer;"><input style="margin-top: 0.15rem;" type="checkbox"><span>Plot source-limited points (7)<br><span style="font-size: 0.75rem;">These cover only part of the demand up to the sink temperature, so they lie off the sin